   "date": "2019-10-08T13:51:42Z",
   "subject": "Shell reconstruccions in fossils",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone<br><br>I am working with grastropod fossils and I need to do shell reconstructions, does anyone know any methodology for this? Or do you know literature that I can read to do the reconstruction? I&#39;m using 3D geometric morphometry.<br><br>I am attentive to your answers<br><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Bets regards</div>Boris Ulloa-Lagos.</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5TYIpQOUCwAJ",
   "from": "Adams, Dean [EEOB]",
   "author": "4d71c6e24fb21497",
   "date": "2019-10-08T14:31:24Z",
   "subject": "RE: [geomorph-r-package] Shell reconstruccions in fossils",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">This question is a bit outside of the geomorph realm, as it is data pre-processing.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Not quite sure what you mean by ‘reconstruction’. If this means 3D imaging, then one requires a scanning devise. If this means ‘fixing’ broken components, then\r\n I suggest you investigate the text ‘Virtual Anthropology’. They discuss methods of reconstruction of imperfect specimens prior to landmark data collection.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><br>\r\nDean <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Director of Graduate Education, EEB Program<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&qu